# crmsmart Hostinger deploy

Two release lines. Do not mix them.

## Branches

- **`main`** = smartaesthetics (`crm.smartaesthetics.pk`). Only merge aestheticlinics work into `main` when the user asks to ship the same change there.
- **`aestheticlinics`** = aestheticlinics (`crm.aestheticlinics.net`). All aestheticlinics-only work stays on this branch.

## Shared rules

1. Never commit `.deploy/`, `.env`, or Hostinger passwords. Public repo: https://github.com/gulraizazam/crmsmart (`github` remote).
2. Deploy by git push, then `git pull` on the box. Do not hand-edit production files.
3. Writes on a live box (`.env`, `migrate`, cache rebuilds, composer) need an explicit yes unless the user asked to deploy in that turn.

